   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Neuter accusative",
     "texto": [
      "With many neuter nouns, the accusative form is the same as the nominative: **nowe krzesło**, **ciepłe mleko**.",
      "The adjective also keeps the neuter form in **-e** or **-ie**. The ending depends on the noun's gender, not on its role in the sentence."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
  },
